<section class="bh-section bh-age" id="bh-age">
  <div class="bh-wrap"><div class="bh-age-wrap2">
    <div class="bh-reveal">
      <h2 class="bh-h2"><strong>Most People Wait</strong> Too Long</h2>
      <p class="bh-sub">Pain shows up differently at every age. Most people ignore the early signs until it&rsquo;s much harder to reverse.</p>    </div>
    <p class="bh-age-intro bh-reveal">Here is what your body is most<br class="bh-br-d"> vulnerable <strong>to and </strong><em>when.</em></p>
    <div class="bh-age-line bh-reveal">
            <div class="bh-age-row bh-reveal n0">
        <span class="bh-age-dot">20s</span>
        <div>
          <h4>Posture problems <em>begin</em></h4>
          <p>Tech neck, wrist strain and poor desk habits start building the foundation for chronic pain.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
            <div class="bh-age-row bh-reveal n1">
        <span class="bh-age-dot">30s</span>
        <div>
          <h4>The decade it <em>shows up</em></h4>
          <p>Lower back pain, knee issues and repetitive strain become hard to ignore for the first time.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
            <div class="bh-age-row bh-reveal n2">
        <span class="bh-age-dot">40s</span>
        <div>
          <h4>Compensation <em>kicks in</em></h4>
          <p>Your body starts compensating for old injuries. What feels manageable starts limiting how you move.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
            <div class="bh-age-row bh-reveal n3">
        <span class="bh-age-dot">50s+</span>
        <div>
          <h4>Chronic <em>becomes daily</em></h4>
          <p>Arthritis, spondylosis and joint degeneration peak. By then, lasting damage is harder to reverse.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
          </div>
    <div class="bh-age-outro bh-reveal">
